      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting, after"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 54, the following sections: 54A. Where any amount is withdrawn from the Fund under sections 54, 55 or paid from the Fund under section 56, the Board shall pay dividend, on such amount so withdrawn, and in such manner as determined by the Board from time to time. 54B. For the purpose of withdrawal under this Act, the date of withdrawal shall be—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where payment is made by a warrant, the date on which the warrant for such withdrawal is issued; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where payment is made in a manner other than by a warrant, the date on which such amount of withdrawal is debited from the account of such member of the Fund.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/13/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting, after"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "59A. section 59, the following section: 59A. Where any person is found guilty of an offence under subsection 59(b), the court before which such person is found guilty shall order such person to furnish or produce any declaration, return, certificate or other document required by this Act or any regulations or rules thereunder to be furnished or produced.\"."
      }
    },
